    "range_meaning": "Assumption: a published from-to range is read as the source's p25-p75. No source defines its bounds.",
    "cell_rule": "Rows of one publisher in a cell are averaged into one range. Across publishers: p25 = median of lows, p75 = median of highs, median = median of midpoints.",
    "inclusion": "Dated 2025-2026 recruiter tables whose buckets line up with ours, with an unambiguous role mapping. Excluded: AllJobs (excludes bonus, undated, runs 5-10K below every recruiter), Ethosia tables (undated, buckets offset by a year), Levels.fyi (annual total comp with stock), Payscale (n=144, implausible p10). See backend/research/RESEARCH_salary_sources.md.",
    "buckets": "junior 0-2, mid 3-5, senior 6-10 (GotFriends' own buckets). No 10+ bucket: no source covers it for most roles.",
